# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tahoe-100M perturbation model — training repository.
#
# Rule of thumb: only source code, small metadata tables (the 3 MB drug table,
# the .csv bookkeeping inside data_by_plate_cell_line) and the markdown docs are
# committed. Everything the server needs beyond that is either re-generated
# (models/cache) or copied over out-of-band (the h5ad grid).
#
# Size reference on the dev box: data 1.0 TB, checkpoints 760 MB,
# token cache 67 MB. None of it belongs in git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 1. data: 593 GB + 323 GB + 85 GB -------------------------------------
# data_by_plate_cell_line/ itself IS tracked, but only its four small .csv
# bookkeeping files (_cell_counts_*.csv, _coord_*.csv).
# Everything else in it -- the .h5ad grid, checkpoints, pickles -- is not.
# The `!**/` line is required: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so directories must stay traversable.
data_by_plate_cell_line/**
!data_by_plate_cell_line/**/
!data_by_plate_cell_line/**/*.csv

# ...except pacmap_by_cell_line/, which stays out entirely (193 files, 2.8 GB:
# 48 .pkl embeddings, 48 .npy, 48 .png, 48 .json, 1 _fit_status.csv).
# This line comes after the negations above, and the last matching rule wins.
data_by_plate_cell_line/pacmap_by_cell_line/

data_by_sample_embedded/
metadata/
*.h5ad
*.h5
*.loom
*.zarr/

# --- 2. runtime artifacts --------------------------------------------------
# checkpoints (models/runs/<name>/{last,best}.pt ~380 MB each), CSV logs,
# and the MolFormer token cache (67 MB, rebuild with
# `python models/molformer_atoms.py`)
models/runs/
models/runtime/
models/trained_model/
models/cache/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz

# --- 3. generated analysis output -----------------------------------------
# the .md reports are kept (they document the gradient study); the binary and
# machine-dumped artefacts next to them are not needed to train
models/testing/*.png
models/testing/*.json
models/testing/*.txt
models/testing/*.log
dataset_size_comparison.png

# --- 4. python / editor / OS ----------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- 5. not needed to train (left on the dev box, not shipped) -------------
# uncomment any of these if you decide to version them
Analysis/
docs/
utils/
tests/
!models/tests/
!models/tests/*.py
logs/
groups.json
*.ipynb

# keep the notebook the model was ported from: it is the reference implementation
!models/modelr.ipynb
